    web_gpu_layout_grid_px_tracks_never_admitted_2026-11-27, 1, "2026-11-27 w4-2: fixed in gpu_web/layout/adapter.spl via _web_layout_parse_px_track accepting positive '<N>px' (and bare positive digits) while rejecting fr/auto/0px/malformed tokens. Windows host interpreter: gpu_web_layout_grid_px_admission_spec 2/2 passed (all 5 shard cases), grid_auto_rows_gpu_admission_spec 2/2 passed, web_layout_manager_spec 4/4 passed."

